OL,3,GNEWSAClinicians complete 140-mile bike
OL,4,Aride for charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of clinicians who have cycled
OL,7,F140 miles (225km) across Lancashire and
OL,8,FCumbria are hoping to raise awareness
OL,9,Fabout a programme that helps cancer
OL,10,Fpatients prepare for treatment.
OL,12,FEighteen staff members from Lancashire
OL,13,FTeaching Hospitals took part in the
OL,14,Ftwo-day challenge from Barrow AFC to
OL,15,FBurnley's Turf Moor.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
