OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAClinicians complete 140-mile bike
OL,4,Aride for charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey visited eight football clubs that
OL,7,Fprovide support for cancer patients
OL,8,Fthrough a programme known as
OL,9,Fpre-habilitation, which helps patients
OL,10,Fprepare for treatment by improving
OL,11,Ftheir fitness, nutrition and mental
OL,12,Fwellbeing.
OL,14,FConsultant surgeon Jeremy Ward said the
OL,15,Fclubs provided patients with a social
OL,16,Fmeeting point and fitness classes
OL,17,Fduring a "very stressful period of
OL,18,Ftheir lives".
